--
-- Design principles taken directly from the original creature systems in this
-- file:
--   * Scorpion = compact, detailed, articulated, 15 props.
--   * Feline = compact animal anatomy, 10 props, clear sleep/walk poses.
--   * Spider = many independent limbs, native Humanoid.MoveDirection steering.
--   * Leviathan = genuinely colossal segmented silhouette (~30 studs in code).
--   * Mecha / Gorilla / Toilet Titan = large body plans with independently posed
--     limbs and dedicated color themes.
--
-- IMPORTANT: the Forge is additive. Existing original creatures are untouched.
-- When Forge is disabled it follows the original creature lifecycle and clears
-- the active prop construction immediately with ClearAllProps.
